{"code":"007680","name":"대원","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1972년 모방제조업 및 무역업을 위해 대원모방(주)로 설립되었으며, 1988년 (주)대원으로 상호를 변경하였음. 2017년 코스닥시장에 상장하였으며, 현재 9개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 국내와 해외(베트남)에서 건설사업과 섬유사업을 영위하고 있으며, 건설사업은 칸타빌(Cantavil) 브랜드를 통한 공동주택 분양 및 시공, 산업단지 조성, 도로공사 등 토목공사, 상업용 건축공사를 수행하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":2910.0,"open":2905.0,"high":3000.0,"low":2800.0,"volume":3479,"amount":10123890.0,"ret_1d":-3.3223,"gap":-3.4884,"range_pct":6.8729,"ret_5":0.5181,"ret_20":-9.0625,"ret_60":-13.7778,"ret_120":-35.0446,"ret_250":-36.3239,"ma20":3004.5,"ma60":3249.0833,"ma120":3599.75,"ma200":3844.35,"close_vs_ma200":-24.3045,"close_vs_ma60":-10.4363,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-53.0409,"r2_60":0.6707,"slope_120":-54.4014,"r2_120":0.7511,"slope_250":-32.1054,"r2_250":0.7324,"high52":6110.0,"low52":2720.0,"pos_52w":5.6047,"dd_52w":-52.3732,"mdd_1y":-45.1961,"atr14_pct":6.2469,"vol_ann_60":32.3144,"vol_avg20":8483.4,"vol_ratio20":0.4101,"vr5":0.2763,"vr20":0.1453,"amount_avg5":12779812.0,"amount_avg20":25402569.75,"amount_avg60":41631224.25,"obv_chg20":-42.9722,"turnover_20":1.2832,"pv_eff_20":-7.0627,"rsi14":40.6906,"frgn_net_5":510.0,"inst_net_5":-7032.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0039,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0532,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0493,"frgn_net_20":-4732.0,"inst_net_20":8217.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0358,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0621,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0264,"frgn_net_60":-909.0,"inst_net_60":8998.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0069,"inst_net_60_pct":0.068,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0612,"frgn_net_120":-6997.0,"inst_net_120":7173.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0529,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0542,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0013,"foreign_ratio":0.56,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.08,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":0.0,"op_margin_q":0.0,"op_qoq":null,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":100.0,"rev_yoy":11.5226,"op_trend_4q":106.383,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-0.69,"debt_ratio":90.46,"per":null,"pbr":0.14,"div_y